  "notes": [
    "The anchor is the first re-entrant collectFees, which minted the free locks; each later pair of transactions repeats it and unlocks. The campaign spans the same locker proxy on Ethereum, BSC, Base and Polygon until each chain's fix upgrade, including copycats 0xeac464c0 (BSC) and 0xa39edd43 (Base).",
    "LP tokens have no DefiLlama price: each is valued at twice its pro-rata quote reserve (WETH, WBNB, WPOL) in its pair the block before the drain. DUB and BPAY are valued at the attacker's realised ETH; SNSY and USDC at DefiLlama. The attacker's 410.2 ETH and 523.8 BNB Tornado deposits are of the same order."
  ]
